WEBVTT

00:16.290 --> 00:18.950
[Special Episode]

00:20.390 --> 00:22.150
That timely rain

00:22.150 --> 00:23.830
is said to be divine,

00:23.850 --> 00:26.210
a blessing from heaven.

00:26.400 --> 00:27.460
But actually,

00:27.590 --> 00:29.470
nothing about it was divine.

00:29.630 --> 00:32.090
The truth is simply that Zhu Yan, the evil demon,

00:32.090 --> 00:33.570
sacrificed himself

00:33.600 --> 00:36.490
to save the world.

00:36.800 --> 00:40.790
It rained for three days and three nights.

00:38.480 --> 00:42.680
♫You wear candlelight like a robe, awaiting dawn♫

00:40.810 --> 00:42.010
Since then,

00:42.110 --> 00:45.870
the people of Tiandu have been grateful to him.

00:42.960 --> 00:47.250
♫While I cradle heartache, year after year, on and on♫

00:45.950 --> 00:47.470
Great!

00:47.640 --> 00:49.230
♫In dreams, my hometown♫

00:47.730 --> 00:48.750
How surprising.

00:48.760 --> 00:50.450
The evil demon in the rumor

00:49.350 --> 00:50.200
♫Lies under frost♫

00:50.320 --> 00:53.840
♫All sounds♫

00:50.520 --> 00:51.790
actually sacrificed himself

00:51.790 --> 00:52.650
to save others.

00:52.720 --> 00:54.840
It seems that not all demons are bad

00:54.510 --> 00:56.310
♫Are lost♫

00:54.870 --> 00:56.390
and not all humans are good.

00:56.390 --> 00:57.190
Exactly.

00:57.260 --> 00:59.030
Actually, before Zhu Yan, the evil demon,

00:59.030 --> 01:01.550
sacrificed himself,

01:01.680 --> 01:05.030
he had done many good deeds for the mortal world

01:05.069 --> 01:06.870
and also many foolish

01:06.870 --> 01:08.870
and laughable things.

01:09.350 --> 01:10.180
The story

01:10.510 --> 01:13.990
started with Baize Goddess.

01:18.560 --> 01:20.510
I promised to give you a love token.

01:21.340 --> 01:23.060
I carved it myself.

01:23.660 --> 01:25.090
There is only one

01:26.690 --> 01:28.000
in the entire world.

01:30.830 --> 01:32.070
As long as our love

01:32.560 --> 01:33.990
remains the same,

01:36.280 --> 01:37.479
we're afraid of

01:38.750 --> 01:40.410
the ever-changing world.

01:43.960 --> 01:46.360
Looks like Great Demon's death was worth it.

01:46.360 --> 01:47.450
Look.

01:48.150 --> 01:49.240
So many people

01:49.770 --> 01:50.979
still remember him.

01:54.560 --> 01:55.920
He was…

02:01.750 --> 02:03.270
He was…

02:11.710 --> 02:13.290
At the last moment,

02:13.880 --> 02:16.410
I used a sword technique called Cloud Leading

02:16.850 --> 02:19.370
to extract a small part of his soul

02:19.860 --> 02:21.660
and give him a chance to survive.

02:29.920 --> 02:31.770
Just like what he did to Li Lun.

02:34.750 --> 02:36.910
Haven't you found his soul yet?

02:37.070 --> 02:38.780
Only my Cloud Light Sword

02:39.030 --> 02:41.270
can recognize that shred of his soul.

02:42.030 --> 02:43.150
Before that,

02:43.590 --> 02:46.480
he can only wander around the world.

02:47.290 --> 02:48.530
It's been months.

02:50.470 --> 02:51.470
I still don't know

02:51.470 --> 02:53.510
where his soul is.

02:55.270 --> 02:57.510
Speaking of Baize Goddess,

02:57.670 --> 03:00.790
I have to mention Zhu Yan again.

03:00.910 --> 03:01.710
Alas,

03:02.120 --> 03:03.590
their encounter

03:03.590 --> 03:05.680
was like the myth

03:05.680 --> 03:08.070
about Zhu Bajie and Chang'e.

03:08.310 --> 03:09.270
Fate

03:09.270 --> 03:10.750
brought them together,

03:10.790 --> 03:11.750
but their story

03:11.750 --> 03:14.790
was destined to be a tragedy.

03:27.829 --> 03:29.890
The Chongwu Camp has been disbanded.

03:29.990 --> 03:32.550
The Demon Hunting Bureau is in charge of all demon-related cases.

03:32.550 --> 03:33.150
Ms. Pei,

03:33.430 --> 03:34.790
shouldn't you be too busy

03:34.790 --> 03:36.390
to come here for tea and stories?

03:36.390 --> 03:38.450
I don't have time for tea and stories,

03:40.070 --> 03:41.510
but I can always make time

03:42.860 --> 03:45.120
to meet my friends no matter how busy I am.

03:57.480 --> 03:58.750
I heard that the Demon Hunting Bureau

03:58.750 --> 04:00.410
recruited a lot of new people.

04:01.030 --> 04:01.830
Yes.

04:02.670 --> 04:05.060
Some of them are quite aspiring.

04:06.310 --> 04:07.840
They're almost the same age

04:08.140 --> 04:09.110
as Jiu,

04:09.510 --> 04:10.240
Siheng,

04:10.510 --> 04:11.590
and Ying Lei.

04:14.430 --> 04:15.990
When I train them every day,

04:17.910 --> 04:19.070
it feels as if

04:20.430 --> 04:22.510
they're still around.

04:26.990 --> 04:28.450
Pei Siheng was very brave.

04:31.990 --> 04:33.520
Jiu and Ying Lei

04:34.990 --> 04:36.240
were very brave too.

04:44.350 --> 04:45.680
Under your leadership,

04:45.830 --> 04:46.909
those recruits

04:48.550 --> 04:50.480
will definitely become like them.

04:51.970 --> 04:53.409
Are you really leaving?

04:58.870 --> 04:59.909
I must find

04:59.909 --> 05:02.110
the last shred of Zhao Yuanzhou's soul.

05:03.830 --> 05:04.810
Otherwise,

05:06.140 --> 05:07.710
I'd be racked by guilt

05:09.210 --> 05:10.470
for the rest of my life.

05:14.510 --> 05:15.890
Where do you plan to go?

05:22.930 --> 05:25.330
All mountains and seas in the mortal world,

05:25.390 --> 05:27.590
and the 28 mountains in the Wilderness,

05:28.320 --> 05:30.520
I'll search them one by one.

05:37.110 --> 05:39.110
I'll leave the Demon Hunting Bureau

05:39.200 --> 05:40.830
in your care.

05:44.270 --> 05:45.150
Don't worry.

05:45.830 --> 05:47.300
Wen Xiao and I

05:47.420 --> 05:49.860
will manage the Demon Hunting Bureau well.

05:50.370 --> 05:53.170
After all, it used to be the Zhuo family's mansion.

05:54.140 --> 05:55.870
We'll wait for you to come back.

06:05.910 --> 06:06.910
I'm leaving, too.

06:13.210 --> 06:14.090
Are you…

06:16.400 --> 06:18.060
going back to the Wilderness?

06:18.780 --> 06:19.620
Yes.

06:21.870 --> 06:23.670
I'm going back to the Wilderness

06:23.960 --> 06:25.550
to protect his homeland.

06:27.720 --> 06:29.490
He said Ran Yi told him

06:30.280 --> 06:32.020
that animals

06:33.170 --> 06:35.970
spend their whole lives seeking food and shelter,

06:37.550 --> 06:38.860
and only people

06:40.240 --> 06:42.240
want to return to their homes.

06:43.480 --> 06:45.500
I've always wanted to be a human.

06:47.080 --> 06:47.830
Humans

06:50.030 --> 06:52.420
all want to return to their homes.

06:56.970 --> 06:58.870
I'll fulfill

07:01.100 --> 07:02.860
his unfulfilled wish for him.

08:03.910 --> 08:04.940
I'm leaving.

08:07.710 --> 08:09.970
I came to take one last look at this place.

08:15.670 --> 08:17.710
When I was cleaning up Jiu's room,

08:19.060 --> 08:20.900
I found that he left a box for you.

09:01.700 --> 09:02.780
Somehow,

09:04.260 --> 09:07.050
Jiu removed the tongue of the bell.

09:07.090 --> 09:09.890
With its tongue missing, it doesn't ring anymore.

09:10.790 --> 09:13.660
He also left you an obscure medical book.

09:28.870 --> 09:29.800
Zhuo.

09:32.570 --> 09:33.880
I brought you something to eat.

09:32.780 --> 09:36.520
♫Footsteps echo, one by one♫

09:33.880 --> 09:34.570
Thank you.

09:37.170 --> 09:39.980
♫Sorrows scattered, lost to the wind♫

09:41.300 --> 09:45.080
♫Not forgetting, nor dwelling on♫

09:45.440 --> 09:48.290
♫The way back home♫

09:47.120 --> 09:48.360
I don't know

09:48.530 --> 09:50.130
many of the words on that.

09:49.070 --> 09:50.700
♫With strong will♫

09:51.030 --> 09:54.570
♫I slowly carve out♫

09:51.360 --> 09:52.690
I can't pronounce them.

09:53.140 --> 09:54.460
You're amazing, Jiu.

09:55.210 --> 09:56.980
♫Growth♫

09:57.310 --> 09:58.610
Actually,

09:57.540 --> 09:59.040
♫Turning back♫

09:58.750 --> 10:00.530
some words

09:59.560 --> 10:02.950
♫I find you still in that familiar place♫

10:00.880 --> 10:02.200
are new to me too.

10:03.320 --> 10:04.910
So I don't read them out loud.

10:03.760 --> 10:05.560
♫Waiting there♫

10:05.780 --> 10:06.760
If I pronounce them wrong,

10:06.260 --> 10:08.080
♫Someone is singing♫

10:07.580 --> 10:08.850
people will laugh at me.

10:08.140 --> 10:10.000
♫Can you hear it?♫

10:10.090 --> 10:11.070
Then forget about them.

10:11.070 --> 10:11.800
Forget.

10:11.650 --> 10:14.280
♫The burning hoarseness♫

10:11.820 --> 10:13.170
Forget.

10:13.450 --> 10:13.930
Here.

10:14.330 --> 10:16.200
♫It sprouts♫

10:16.270 --> 10:18.160
♫And then blooms♫

10:18.760 --> 10:21.890
♫The time of loneliness♫

10:22.930 --> 10:24.710
♫Someone is singing♫

10:24.780 --> 10:26.670
♫Don't forget♫

10:27.770 --> 10:30.190
♫Time is fleeting♫

10:30.990 --> 10:34.860
♫The snow is all over the hill♫

10:34.960 --> 10:35.920
♫Again♫

10:36.800 --> 10:38.440
♫I'm going home♫

10:39.230 --> 10:40.280
♫Sunset♫

10:41.410 --> 10:43.560
♫Old tiles♫

10:43.690 --> 10:47.530
♫Manjusaka♫

10:48.030 --> 10:49.680
♫A single wing♫

10:49.730 --> 10:51.550
♫Struggles to♫

10:51.900 --> 10:56.070
♫Maintain a dual balance♫

10:53.970 --> 10:55.380
This is what Jiu

10:57.920 --> 10:59.500
wanted to tell me.

11:00.460 --> 11:01.970
♫Someone is singing♫

11:02.080 --> 11:03.970
♫Can we meet again?♫

11:05.660 --> 11:07.960
♫Sunset is red from crying♫

11:08.160 --> 11:09.120
Good.

11:08.740 --> 11:10.610
♫When my heart♫

11:10.330 --> 11:11.490
It's not ringing.

11:10.740 --> 11:12.730
♫Is covered with frost♫

11:12.970 --> 11:15.920
♫It turns into the bright moon♫

11:17.060 --> 11:18.790
♫Someone is singing♫

11:18.870 --> 11:20.820
♫The night is long♫

11:21.330 --> 11:22.420
♫I polish my sadness♫

11:22.510 --> 11:25.070
♫Quietly♫

11:25.540 --> 11:29.590
♫The bell rings unemotionally♫

11:29.630 --> 11:30.990
♫Nowhere♫

11:31.090 --> 11:32.670
♫To hide♫

11:35.930 --> 11:37.660
♫Someone is singing♫

11:37.790 --> 11:39.970
♫Can you hear it?♫

11:41.080 --> 11:42.550
He wanted to tell me…

11:41.180 --> 11:43.450
♫The burning hoarseness♫

11:43.890 --> 11:45.120
Zhuo.

11:44.170 --> 11:45.930
♫It sprouts♫

11:46.050 --> 11:48.110
♫And then blooms♫

11:47.790 --> 11:48.870
Remember.

11:48.530 --> 11:51.520
♫The time of loneliness♫

11:51.750 --> 11:52.610
Don't miss him.

11:52.710 --> 11:54.320
♫Someone is singing♫

11:54.380 --> 11:56.500
♫I hold the light♫

11:55.660 --> 11:56.650
Forget him.

11:56.670 --> 11:57.620
♫I want to go♫

11:57.720 --> 12:00.500
♫Where you are♫

12:00.960 --> 12:04.550
♫The bell rings unemotionally♫

12:04.750 --> 12:05.830
Zhuo.

12:05.040 --> 12:06.370
♫I'm missing you♫

12:06.450 --> 12:08.260
♫Again♫

12:06.760 --> 12:07.670
Don't miss me.

12:08.800 --> 12:09.740
Forget me.

12:11.230 --> 12:12.890
♫Winter snow♫

12:13.000 --> 12:14.750
♫Spring light♫

12:15.620 --> 12:18.230
♫Everything is thriving in the rain♫

12:19.500 --> 12:21.270
♫Drifting♫

12:21.860 --> 12:23.570
♫Swaying♫

12:23.780 --> 12:26.860
♫Torn clothes♫

12:27.450 --> 12:29.280
♫With a strong heart♫

12:29.330 --> 12:33.050
♫I'll build a wall to trap♫

12:33.870 --> 12:35.190
♫Sadness♫

12:35.810 --> 12:37.240
♫Turning back♫

12:37.750 --> 12:41.740
♫Youth is still♫

12:42.500 --> 12:44.820
♫Where it was♫

13:14.550 --> 13:15.350
Mr. Zhuo.

13:16.390 --> 13:16.870
I...

13:16.990 --> 13:17.790
I'm Bai Jiu.

13:28.590 --> 13:29.350
Zhuo, Zhuo.

13:29.380 --> 13:31.270
Zhuo, let me tell you something interesting.

13:31.270 --> 13:32.450
When Ying Lei was cooking just now,

13:32.450 --> 13:33.660
a bird passed by

13:33.680 --> 13:34.860
and pooped into his bowl.

13:34.860 --> 13:35.750
Then he took a bite.

13:35.750 --> 13:37.110
It was hilarious.

13:37.510 --> 13:38.310
Zhuo.

13:44.310 --> 13:45.110
Zhuo.

14:55.620 --> 14:57.900
♫The little city♫

14:57.980 --> 14:59.510
♫Traps♫

14:59.570 --> 15:01.780
♫The little us♫

15:02.090 --> 15:05.010
♫Going around and around♫

15:05.470 --> 15:06.850
♫Dusk and dawn♫

15:07.970 --> 15:10.080
♫The heavy door♫

15:08.940 --> 15:15.570
[Great Demon will be with Wen Xiao as long as he lives]

15:10.520 --> 15:11.610
♫Who is♫

15:11.760 --> 15:13.980
♫Waiting foolishly♫

15:14.330 --> 15:19.030
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

15:20.390 --> 15:22.470
♫The pillow of the past♫

15:21.410 --> 15:27.270
[Great Demon will be with Wen Xiao as long as he lives]

15:22.760 --> 15:23.910
♫Still has♫

15:24.020 --> 15:26.310
♫The warmth of the dream♫

15:26.480 --> 15:28.630
♫The dust from yesterday♫

15:28.890 --> 15:31.580
♫Covering my eyes♫

15:32.710 --> 15:34.720
♫The person in the dream♫

15:33.820 --> 15:37.490
[Great Demon will be with Wen Xiao as long as he lives]

15:34.930 --> 15:36.190
♫Is silent♫

15:36.280 --> 15:38.550
♫Waiting with each step♫

15:38.870 --> 15:42.140
♫Refuses to leave, and refuses♫

15:42.170 --> 15:43.800
♫To turn around♫

15:44.920 --> 15:46.290
♫The spring breeze♫

15:46.380 --> 15:48.480
♫Seems to have♫

15:48.820 --> 15:50.980
♫Many stories♫

15:51.220 --> 15:52.580
♫In her heart♫

15:52.680 --> 15:55.610
♫There is a name♫

15:57.380 --> 15:58.780
♫The human world♫

15:58.870 --> 16:01.080
♫The ink is mottled♫

16:01.150 --> 16:03.320
♫Love, hate, absurdity, mistakes♫

16:01.720 --> 16:05.520
[Great Demon will be with Wen Xiao as long as he lives]

16:03.400 --> 16:04.760
♫Can't clearly write it♫

16:05.020 --> 16:06.140
♫Can't completely express it♫

16:06.560 --> 16:08.660
♫This karma♫

16:24.630 --> 16:32.770
[Great Demon will be with Wen Xiao as long as he lives]

16:40.110 --> 16:42.230
Zhao Yuanzhou once told me

16:42.880 --> 16:44.940
that he often stared into space alone

16:45.320 --> 16:47.810
by the sea in the Wilderness.

16:49.950 --> 16:51.590
Because the sea

16:51.630 --> 16:53.920
never cared about his sadness

16:54.130 --> 16:55.190
and loneliness.

16:57.270 --> 16:59.970
The sea has a lot to worry about.

17:00.720 --> 17:02.040
Every day,

17:02.840 --> 17:04.940
there are 10,000 waves

17:05.160 --> 17:07.069
born in its embrace.

17:08.800 --> 17:10.109
And every day,

17:10.220 --> 17:12.819
10,000 lives fall into the sea,

17:12.940 --> 17:15.050
and then their souls sink into deep sleep.

17:14.210 --> 17:16.359
♫The heavy door♫

17:16.150 --> 17:17.790
I didn't understand it at that time.

17:16.609 --> 17:20.060
♫Whose youth is behind it♫

17:17.810 --> 17:19.310
But after he left,

17:19.480 --> 17:20.960
I finally understood

17:20.349 --> 17:25.780
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

17:20.990 --> 17:23.359
that bone-deep sadness.

17:23.970 --> 17:25.970
It was the base color of his soul.

17:26.770 --> 17:29.090
Like a broken song,

17:29.240 --> 17:30.370
vast,

17:30.560 --> 17:31.430
distant,

17:32.100 --> 17:32.950
and desolate.

17:37.010 --> 17:39.100
I used to be like him.

17:39.410 --> 17:40.870
I often stared into space by the pool

17:40.870 --> 17:43.330
in the backyard of the Demon Hunting Bureau.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.340
But in front of me,

17:47.110 --> 17:49.540
there was only a small pool of water.

17:50.290 --> 17:52.750
It was so small that it reflected only a lamp,

17:53.110 --> 17:54.210
the moon,

17:55.120 --> 17:57.680
and my shallow hatred.

18:01.830 --> 18:04.740
I always forgot that he'd lived for 30,000 years

18:02.510 --> 18:05.310
♫The hazy dusk approaches♫

18:05.240 --> 18:07.330
while I'd only lived for 30 years.

18:05.980 --> 18:08.790
♫The old days are sinking and weighing heavy on my heart♫

18:08.270 --> 18:09.390
In his eyes,

18:09.410 --> 18:12.890
♫A great dream covers new clothes♫

18:10.210 --> 18:12.350
I must have looked like a child,

18:12.870 --> 18:15.400
angrily waving my fist.

18:12.980 --> 18:15.400
♫Sleeping without waking♫

18:16.230 --> 18:19.010
♫The blue lake traps♫

18:19.640 --> 18:22.540
♫The reflections of old friends♫

18:23.150 --> 18:25.800
♫The ocean tides rise and fall♫

18:26.040 --> 18:29.350
♫Thoughts are inaudible♫

18:30.000 --> 18:32.960
♫Bitter memories♫

18:33.000 --> 18:36.630
♫Hide in the gap of my heart♫

18:36.700 --> 18:39.530
♫One heart chamber, one window♫

18:39.590 --> 18:42.590
♫Traces of light♫

18:43.670 --> 18:46.600
♫Murmuring breaths♫

18:46.660 --> 18:49.660
♫Like riddles by the pillow♫

18:50.140 --> 18:53.310
♫I only dare to look at you in dreams♫

18:53.610 --> 18:56.170
♫Yet I don't utter a word♫

18:56.960 --> 19:00.320
♫Let the spring light hear♫

19:00.830 --> 19:03.720
♫The autumn moon also hears♫

19:03.750 --> 19:06.690
♫Every rainfall♫

19:06.750 --> 19:10.200
♫Is my secret♫

19:10.210 --> 19:14.000
♫Searching memories endlessly♫

19:14.070 --> 19:16.890
♫The drenched past♫

19:17.140 --> 19:19.840
♫Reflects you♫

19:20.560 --> 19:23.310
♫Find you♫

19:24.500 --> 19:27.260
♫The summer cicadas also hear♫

19:28.190 --> 19:30.960
♫The winter snow also hears♫

19:31.340 --> 19:33.910
♫Every reflection♫

19:34.230 --> 19:37.300
♫Shatters the dream's duckweed♫

19:37.770 --> 19:41.230
♫I'm afraid to close my eyes♫

19:41.650 --> 19:44.440
♫Yet unwilling to leave♫

19:44.720 --> 19:47.580
♫The wind unsettled♫

19:48.160 --> 19:50.860
♫The waves uncalm♫

19:51.460 --> 19:54.090
♫The dream never ends♫

19:58.290 --> 20:00.910
♫The dream never ends♫

20:34.240 --> 20:40.290
♫Someday I'll return to my old hometown♫

20:41.140 --> 20:47.170
♫Wearing old clothes but with eyes shining bright♫

20:48.070 --> 20:50.060
♫Holding brilliance in the right hand♫

20:50.090 --> 20:52.010
♫Biting down on all panic♫

20:52.030 --> 20:53.510
♫Wiping away frost with the left hand♫

20:53.560 --> 20:55.360
♫I finally look up♫

20:55.390 --> 20:58.250
♫You're in front of me♫

20:59.130 --> 21:01.290
♫Blocking the pain♫

21:02.020 --> 21:05.340
♫Who cries with swollen eyes?♫

21:05.960 --> 21:08.800
♫With a broken heart♫

21:09.030 --> 21:11.840
♫Walking, stopping♫

21:11.890 --> 21:14.800
♫Chasing your voice♫

21:15.330 --> 21:18.990
♫I'll turn into raindrops♫

21:19.270 --> 21:21.940
♫An ancient song♫

21:22.250 --> 21:25.080
♫Running towards you♫

21:25.570 --> 21:28.470
♫Looking for you♫

21:29.570 --> 21:32.440
